  "design": {
    "decision": "Each extra bid trick adds 2 to the multiplier. A set multiplies the loss too, so every bid becomes a real wager.",
    "opponent": "Shown on the first scored round. Opponents defend harder against big contracts because a set now costs this team more.",
    "rationale": "This is the purest contract-scaled multiplier. It applies on sets as well, so it builds bid tension both ways, and it is higher-risk, bigger-reward than cb-contract-mult-made.",
